<title>POLAND: KREDYT HAS NO COMMENT ON BRANCH DENIAL.</title>
<headline>KREDYT HAS NO COMMENT ON BRANCH DENIAL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish bank Kredyt Bank SA had no comment on Thursday's decision by the Lithuanian central bank to deny Kredyt Bank's request to establish a branch in the Baltic state, an official at the bank's press office said.</p>
<p>Kredyt bank, which opened a representative office in Lithuania last year, was the first foreign bank to apply for permission to open a branch there after parliament passed a law in June lifting a ban on foreign banks.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
